"""Long-form article — Best LED Light Bars & Light Kits for 2018–2026 Jeep Wrangler JL.
Mirrors the approved pilot (ford_f150_2021_tonneau.py). No invented hands-on testing: every spec below comes
from the manufacturer/retailer pages listed in sources (checked 2026-09-24). Light bars themselves are
universal; what is JL-specific is the mount, the wiring and the trim exclusions (392, Mojave, 4xe), so the
picks are JL mount kits and complete JL light kits whose Amazon titles name the Wrangler JL.
"""

